  "name": {
   "zh": "摄影机与深度 · ViPE",
   "en": "Camera and Depth · ViPE"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "ViPE 官方自述：从无约束的原始视频估计摄影机内参、摄影机运动和接近真实尺度的稠密深度贴图。官方把它分成两段跑——先解位姿，再在位姿上估计深度贴图；这张卡就照这两段接成两个节点，交付摄影机（USD 与 Nuke 摄影机）和与它对齐的深度贴图。",
   "en": "ViPE describes itself as estimating camera intrinsics, camera motion and near-metric dense depth maps from unconstrained raw video. Upstream runs it in two passes, first solving poses and then estimating depth on those poses; this card wires the two passes as two nodes and delivers the camera (USD and Nuke camera) and depth maps aligned to it."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-11T11:00:00",
  "deliverable": "camera_traj",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
